Install CRD's
-------------
kubectl apply --server-side -f https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/gateway-api/releases/download/v1.5.0/standard-install.yaml

Install Nginx Fabric Gateway Controller
---------------------------------------
helm install ngf oci://ghcr.io/nginx/charts/nginx-gateway-fabric --create-namespace -n nginx-gateway

Note: When we create Gateway resource, Nginc gateway controller detects that and creates svc and deployment which is useful for routing traffic according to HTTPRoute resource.

Port forward to the newly created svc and send curl request with Host header from killerkoda.

curl --verbose --header "Host: www.example.com" http://localhost:9595

